  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing the Women, Peace and Security Agenda in Libya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Women Peace and Security Agenda in Libya will be advanced by a) ensuring Libyan women participate and advocate effectively in all peacebuilding processes, b) enabling Libyan Women to work across divides through coalitions to call for a gender inclusive approach enhancing their access to leadership and c) ensuring International and National bodies meet WPS commitments, mainstreaming gender across political and peacebuilding processes.</narrative>
  </description>
